00:08:29.724 --> 00:08:32.878
I'm like pouring $100,000 a week into ads.

00:08:32.878 --> 00:08:36.061
I don't even know how to
squeeze it any fucking harder.

00:08:36.061 --> 00:08:40.452
So for a lot of people here,
so many of your ambitions

00:08:40.452 --> 00:08:43.604
