squeezed the current thing.

00:08:50.970 --> 00:08:52.587
One of the greatest mistakes in my career

00:08:52.587 --> 00:08:54.508
happened in 2007.

00:08:54.508 --> 00:08:59.070
I was literally one of
the first people ever

00:08:59.070 --> 00:09:00.450
to produce a YouTube video

00:09:00.450 --> 00:09:03.730
that was longer than five
minutes long, literally.

00:09:03.730 --> 00:09:07.060
I had the longest consistent
long form show on YouTube

00:09:07.060 --> 00:09:10.519
on 2006 and '07, but
because of my impatience

00:09:10.519 --> 00:09:13.171
or because I chased economics,

00:09:13.171 --> 00:09:15.645
a platform came along called Vidler,

00:09:15.645 --> 00:09:18.603
which was a YouTube
competitor and offered me

00:09:18.603 --> 00:09:20.777
7% of the company to move my show,

00:09:20.777 --> 00:09:23.360
Wine Library TV to Vidler.

00:09:23.360 --> 00:09:25.790
I did that because it seemed ridiculous.

00:09:25.790 --> 00:09:27.475
7%, it seemed like a great deal,

00:09:27.475 --> 00:09:30.870
