00:11:06.218 --> 00:11:09.621
No question, the thing
that makes me different

00:11:09.621 --> 00:11:12.718
at 42 than I was at 24 is my understanding

00:11:12.718 --> 00:11:15.819
at how much slower new technologies are

00:11:15.819 --> 00:11:18.780
